d 'GOOGLESHEETS': module to read, write, and edit Google Sheets directly from Stata
d
d  googlesheets mirrors the import excel / export excel / putexcel
d family, but talks to live Google Sheets via the Sheets API.
d Surgical placement of values and matrices, on-demand cell
d formatting, sheet (tab) management, and filtered reads of Google
d Forms response sheets. Subcommands: import, export, put, format,
d list, ping, addsheet, deletesheet, renamesheet. Talking to the
d API needs a one-time Google Cloud OAuth setup; see the One-time
d setup section of -help googlesheets-. The package creates a
d private Python venv on first run and installs the Google client
d libraries into it. 
d
d KW: google sheets; spreadsheets; import; export; putexcel; api; oauth; forms
d
d Requires: Stata version 17
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261113
d
d Author: Eric Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
 ../_/_gs_field.ado
